378
00:35:13.290 --> 00:35:16.080
One day as squires. you will help knights

379
00:35:16.170 --> 00:35:20.080
find and identify prewar tech.

380
00:35:20.170 --> 00:35:23.000
Aspirant Maximus.

381
00:35:27.830 --> 00:35:30.880
Can you identify this relic?

382
00:35:32.630 --> 00:35:34.500
It's a...

383
00:35:34.580 --> 00:35:36.210
...rotor?

384
00:35:37.790 --> 00:35:39.580
A circuit.

385
00:35:39.670 --> 00:35:42.880
The ability to defend yourself
is but one part of your training.

386
00:35:42.960 --> 00:35:48.630
We are the finders and the preservers.

387
00:35:48.710 --> 00:35:51.380
Unless you know what to find and preserve.

388
00:35:51.460 --> 00:35:56.210
you are more useful as a corpse.

389
00:36:39.290 --> 00:36:40.750
Yeah. look at that shit.

390
00:36:46.670 --> 00:36:49.710
- What kind of model is that?
- It's the T-60.

391
00:36:49.790 --> 00:36:52.040
Imagine getting to put on
one of those every day.

392
00:36:59.630 --> 00:37:01.920
Wonder why they're here.

393
00:37:03.920 --> 00:37:05.920
A-17.

394
00:37:08.330 --> 00:37:10.290
A-20.

395
00:37:12.080 --> 00:37:13.710
B-11.

396
00:37:15.710 --> 00:37:18.130
N-24.

397
00:37:35.290 --> 00:37:36.560
Come on. I got something
I want to show you.

398
00:37:36.580 --> 00:37:38.130
Latrine duty's a two-person job.

399
00:37:38.210 --> 00:37:40.630
I said come on.

400
00:37:40.710 --> 00:37:42.750
That hole of shit isn't going anywhere.

401
00:38:42.040 --> 00:38:43.630
Aspirant Dane?

402
00:38:45.630 --> 00:38:48.710
- Th-This was my idea. He didn't want--
- You're being summoned. Come with me.

403
