What's going on?

409
00:39:43.130 --> 00:39:45.420
A bunch of us were chosen to get anointed.

410
00:39:45.500 --> 00:39:46.960
Hey.

411
00:39:47.040 --> 00:39:49.250
- What's your title gonna be?
- Squire. To Knight Titus.

412
00:39:49.330 --> 00:39:51.250
And get this. we're going to the Wilds.

413
00:39:51.330 --> 00:39:52.790
Hell yeah. you are!

414
00:39:52.880 --> 00:39:53.880
Dane...

415
00:39:53.960 --> 00:39:55.250
Dane! Dane! Dane!

416
00:39:55.330 --> 00:39:57.500
Dane! Dane! Dane! Dane!

417
00:39:57.580 --> 00:40:00.460
Dane! Dane! Dane! Dane! Dane! Dane!

418
00:40:12.080 --> 00:40:14.080
- Hey. you're next. you're next.
- -Yeah.

419
00:41:01.250 --> 00:41:02.790
What happened?

420
00:41:07.040 --> 00:41:08.130
Give me that.

421
